<Layout title="Accessibility"><PageHero eyebrow="ACCESSIBILITY" title="A clearer experience for everyone." text="We want people to be able to understand and use the Verto website."/><article class="container prose"><h2>Using the website</h2><p>The site supports keyboard navigation, visible focus indicators, labelled form fields, expandable FAQs and layouts that adapt to smaller screens. It respects your device’s reduced-motion preference.</p><h2>Registration support</h2><p>If you find the online form difficult to use, call <a href="tel:+12267995303">+1 (226) 799-5303</a> or email <a href="mailto:travel@vertoimmigrationinc.com">travel@vertoimmigrationinc.com</a> to discuss another way to begin your enquiry. Do not email sensitive documents.</p><h2>Report a barrier</h2><p>Tell us the page, what you were trying to do and the technology you were using, if you are comfortable sharing it. We can use this information to understand the issue and improve the experience.</p></article></Layout>
